% =====================================================================
% ALBUM II - UNDERCURRENT - ABC NOTATION (hook melodies + chords)
% The Five-Album Collabo Cycle - led by UNDERCURRENT (Water Triad)
% =====================================================================
% All nine hook melodies below are ORIGINAL DESK COMPOSITIONS,
% composed by the desk for these lyric drafts - built to each
% hook lyric's rhythm and meter. They are composition drafts
% under the Flagpole, not transcriptions of any recording.
% Production spec (from the Gemini prompt pack): Deep Detroit bounce,
% 92 BPM, D minor. Sub-bass pressure, sparse dark grand piano,
% low strings, brushed toms. Sigma layer: a low binaural tone pair
% beating at 13 Hz, slow and constant. Harmonica wail on
% Tracks 2 and 8 only - the two night-water tracks.
% Chords use the D-minor family: Dm (i), Bb (VI), F (III),
% C (VII), Gm (iv).
% Lyrics: docs/collabo-cycle/ALBUM-2.md (ghost drafts, stamped
% text pending the founder's red pen).
% NOTE (desk flag, not a fix): Track 1's hook singer differs
% between the files - ALBUM-2.md labels it QVEEN BEE (sung),
% the prompt pack calls it NOIR with Lullaby Lux hum. The
% melody below follows ALBUM-2.md; the founder's pen rules.
% Track 9's prompt-pack part list likewise names singers the
% lyric file does not; the folded lyrics in ALBUM-2-PROMPTS.md
% carry the lyric file's labels byte-exact.
% Flagpole of Claim and Coinage: Johnathan 'Qasparr' Monroe,
% ARR, All Rights Reserved, Without Prejudice.
% =====================================================================

X:1
T:Still Water
C:Desk composition for the hook lyric (draft)
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=92
K:Dm
%% Writing seat: NOIR (Scorpio - VENOM)
%% Formation: Qasparr feature verse opens under the surface - Noir carries the body - Qveen Bee feature hook, sung
%% Hook melody: still water - low and level, the tonic held like a held breath; the only rise is a slow swell to F and back.
%% Hook lyric: "Still water, still water, runnin' deep..."
"Dm"A A D D F E D2|"Bb"F F G A G F3|"Dm"A A D E F E3|"C"E E F G A2 G2|
"Dm"A A D D F E D2|"Bb"F F G A G F3|"F"A A c A G F3|"Dm"E D C D2 D3|]

X:2
T:3 A.M. Tide
C:Desk composition for the hook lyric (draft)
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=92
K:Dm
%% Writing seat: LULLABY LUX (Pisces - DEPTH)
%% Formation: Qveen Bee sung lead (feature) - HARMONICA WAIL, track 1 of 2
%% Hook melody: tide swell - rises and falls like water coming in; the peak breaks on the high A and settles back to D.
%% Hook lyric: "Three a.m. tide, pull me under, pull me home..."
"Dm"D D E F E D3|"Gm"G G A G F E3|"Bb"F F G A B2 A2|"C"A A G E C2 D2|
"Dm"D D E F G A3|"Gm"G A B A G F3|"F"A c A G F E3|"Dm"F E D C D4|]

X:3
T:The Ledger
C:Desk composition for the hook lyric (draft)
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=92
K:Dm
%% Writing seat: HARBOR JUNE (Cancer - MEMORY)
%% Formation: Qasparr storytelling feature - Qveen Bee sung hook
%% Hook melody: reciting - narrow and steady, a keeper reading names; the line never strays far from the tonic.
%% Hook lyric: "Write it in the ledger, write it in love..."
"Dm"A A A D A A3|"Dm"A A D E D C3|"F"F F F A G F3|"C"E E G E C2 D2|
"Dm"A A A D A A3|"Bb"F F A G F E3|"F"F G A c A G3|"Dm"F E D E D4|]

X:4
T:Venom in Velvet
C:Desk composition for the hook lyric (draft)
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=92
K:Dm
%% Writing seat: NOIR (Scorpio - VENOM)
%% Formation: Noir carries the body - Qveen Bee feature rap verse leads the middle - Noir hook, whispered
%% Hook melody: quiet danger - low and close, the sting kept under the velvet; the correction in bar 2 rides one bar.
%% Hook lyric: "Venom in velvet, soft to the touch..."
"Dm"D D F E D C3|"Dm"D E F G F E3|"Bb"F G A G F E3|"C"E F G A G2 E2|
"Dm"D D F E D C3|"Gm"G G A B A G3|"F"A G F E D C3|"Dm"D E F E D4|]

