T:Drown the Chorus
C:Desk composition for the hook lyric (draft)
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=92
K:Dm
%% Writing seat: LULLABY LUX (Pisces - DEPTH)
%% Formation: Both headliners, sung - Qasparr feature verse - Lullaby Lux sung-rap close
%% Hook melody: sinking - a slow descent from the high A down to the tonic, baptized and gone under.
%% Hook lyric: "Drown the chorus, let it sink, let it go..."
"Dm"A c A G F E3|"Bb"F G A G F E3|"Dm"D E F G A2 G2|"C"E D C D E2 C2|
"Dm"A c d c A G3|"Bb"F G A B A2 G2|"F"A G F E D C3|"Dm"D C D E D4|]

