%% Hook melody: roll-call chant - repeated notes, counted off like beads; the line lifts only to name the names.
%% Hook lyric: "Say their names, say their dates..."
"Dm"D D D E F E3|"Dm"D D D E D C3|"F"F F F G A G3|"C"E E E F G2 E2|
"Dm"D D D E F E3|"Bb"F F F G A2 F2|"F"A A G F E D3|"Dm"E F E D D4|]

