%% Hook lyric: "Moon over the strait, silver on the deep..."
"Dm"A c d e d c3|"Bb"d c B A G2 F2|"F"A c f e d c3|"C"e d c A G2 E2|
"Dm"A c d e f2 e2|"Gm"d e f d c A3|"F"c d e f e2 d2|"Dm"c A F E D4|]

