%% Writing seat: ALL THREE (Noir - Lullaby Lux - Harbor June)
%% Formation: Title track, all voices - Qveen Bee sung hook + reprise (same melody)
%% Hook melody: the whole river - the widest arc on the album, depth and venom and memory in one line, closing on the tonic.
%% Hook lyric: "Undercurrent, undercurrent, pullin' everything true..."
"Dm"D F A d c A3|"Bb"B A G F E2 D2|"F"F A c A G F3|"C"E G c A G2 E2|
"Dm"D F A d c2 A2|"Gm"G B d c B2 A2|"F"A c d e d2 c2|"Dm"d c A F D4|]
